        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek BTB-86176, Urban Modern  Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back 8 Inch Urban Modern  Door Pull Set comes packaged as a pair of 2 pulls--one for each side of the same door. It will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick. Choose from a huge selection of popular finish colors for an end look that will match your home perfectly. The Urban Modern Back-To-Back Door Handle Pair is great for contemporary spaces.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-BTB-86176-installed.jpg?v=1704354711\" align=\"right\" width=\"230\" height=\"327\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 86176 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. Packaged with 2 door pulls (1 door pull for each side of a door).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/urban-modern-8-inch-door-pull-emtek-86176\"><b>Urban Modern Pull with Thru-Bolt Mounting</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Urban Modern Solid Brass Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 7/8\" x 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
